WEBVTT

00:09.290 --> 00:11.040
I'm sorry, this is all I have.

00:11.420 --> 00:14.830
The soldiers took away all my coffee
and other expensive things.

00:14.830 --> 00:16.880
They claimed they need it for the war effort.

00:17.460 --> 00:19.380
Have you seen the main street?

00:19.380 --> 00:22.380
Our beautiful city streets have been
reduced to piles of rubble.

00:23.080 --> 00:25.710
You were unlucky to get caught up in all of this, Cid.

00:26.170 --> 00:29.170
Of course, I only just opened an inn here myself.

00:29.920 --> 00:34.080
<i>After leaving the Midgar Kingdom alone,
I just wandered wherever my fancy took me,</i>

00:34.080 --> 00:36.210
<i>and it gave me an opportunity to
take another look at myself.</i>

00:36.380 --> 00:39.460
<i>I did start this trip as a
journey of self-discovery, after all.</i>

00:40.040 --> 00:42.670
<i>Until now, in the various situations
I've found myself in,</i>

00:42.670 --> 00:45.330
<i>I've done what I felt would take me closest
to becoming the Eminence in Shadow.</i>

00:45.920 --> 00:47.330
<i>But thinking back,</i>

00:47.330 --> 00:51.580
<i>I never really had a clear image of what exactly
the Eminence in Shadow should be.</i>

00:52.080 --> 00:56.250
<i>When stuff came up, I think I was just happy to do
whatever kinda looked Eminence-in-Shadowy.</i>

00:57.000 --> 00:59.670
<i>Should I really keep going in this direction?</i>

01:00.420 --> 01:03.750
<i>I feel like something's missing.
Am I imagining it?</i>

01:05.880 --> 01:07.920
Can things really go on like this?

01:09.790 --> 01:11.960
No, of course not.

01:12.460 --> 01:14.130
We can't give up.

01:14.830 --> 01:17.040
We must never, ever give up.

01:17.750 --> 01:18.960
Here you are.

01:20.290 --> 01:21.290
Don't mind if I do!

01:21.290 --> 01:23.330
Hey! That was mine!

01:24.460 --> 01:28.540
Didn't your grandma ever teach you not to take
other people's food without permission?

01:28.540 --> 01:31.000
I-I'll make you another one right away.

01:31.170 --> 01:32.500
Make mine without parsley.

01:32.500 --> 01:34.250
<i>I have to do something.
</i>You're going to eat more?!<b></b>

01:36.380 --> 01:37.580
I'm sorry.

01:39.630 --> 01:41.040
I'm so sorry.

01:46.750 --> 01:48.830
That is too late

01:48.830 --> 01:51.750
You can't catch up with a move like that anymore
Sonna te ja mou oitsukenai<b></b>

01:51.750 --> 01:53.880
That is to say...

01:56.830 --> 02:03.040
The first move chooses an unknown future
Saisho no itte de erabu michi naru future<b></b>

02:03.040 --> 02:05.380
How it will be
Sono arisama<b></b>

02:05.710 --> 02:06.830
This way

02:06.830 --> 02:13.080
The last move decides the world's answer
Saigo no itte de kimeru sekai no answer<b></b>

02:13.080 --> 02:15.710
A single winner
Hitori no winner<b></b>

02:15.710 --> 02:17.080
It's me

02:17.330 --> 02:19.630
These eyes have seen it
Kono me wa misueta<b></b>

02:21.130 --> 02:26.750
The optimal solution no one has yet been able to discern
Dare mo imada mitoosenu saitekikai o<b></b>

02:28.040 --> 02:31.830
It's all a game to control the board
Subete wa banjou shihai suru game<b></b>

02:31.830 --> 02:34.330
A battle of thought
Shikou no tousou<b></b>

02:34.500 --> 02:36.880
I disguise even my mistakes
Mistake sae mo gisou shite<b></b>

02:36.880 --> 02:39.460
And even checkmate is a preparatory move
Checkmate made fuseki toshite<b></b>

02:39.460 --> 02:41.880
A game to take each other's king
King o ubaiau game<b></b>

02:41.880 --> 02:44.330
Ideology and desire
Shisou to yokubou<b></b>

02:44.630 --> 02:47.000
A bad move to not let one chance get away
One chance minogasanu akushu<b></b>

02:47.000 --> 02:49.670
The last chance will cinch it
Last chance kanarazu shitomeru<b></b>

02:49.920 --> 02:51.920
That is too late

02:51.920 --> 02:54.830
You can't catch up with a move like that anymore
Sonna te ja mou oitsukenai<b></b>

02:54.830 --> 02:57.000
That is to say

02:57.000 --> 03:01.960
Total victory is in my hands
Kanzen shouri wa kono te no naka ni<b></b>

03:07.250 --> 03:10.080
No one can catch up now
Dare nimo mou oitsukenai<b></b>

03:20.170 --> 03:22.080
Rose...

03:23.080 --> 03:25.920
I will...

03:28.290 --> 03:30.000
Father...

03:30.000 --> 03:33.830
I will never forgive you.

03:34.580 --> 03:38.460
<b>#09 The Key</b>

03:39.630 --> 03:41.290
First Castle Town...

03:41.920 --> 03:44.330
It used to be such a beautiful place.

03:44.960 --> 03:47.130
But even this city couldn't escape the fires of war.

03:47.830 --> 03:51.790
I felt that, if I joined Shadow Garden,
I could do something.

03:52.290 --> 03:56.130
I thought that if I got stronger,
I would be able to save my kingdom.

03:56.630 --> 03:57.830
But I...

03:59.710 --> 04:01.670
Number 666, it's time.

04:01.670 --> 04:03.250
Hurry, hurry!

04:03.250 --> 04:04.830
I'll be right out.

04:08.290 --> 04:10.920
Number 559 will be leading the mission today.

04:11.170 --> 04:14.500
559? Isn't she the one who...

04:14.790 --> 04:20.130
Yes, she's the eminent fighter who beat Number 89
and won the right to challenge Numbers.

04:20.670 --> 04:21.920
Eminent...

04:22.460 --> 04:24.830
If there's something on your mind, talk to us about it.

04:25.130 --> 04:27.500
No, it's nothing.

04:28.580 --> 04:29.790
Fine.

04:30.170 --> 04:32.040
I'd like three with sauce, please!

04:32.710 --> 04:34.540
You need to have more on your mind!

04:34.540 --> 04:37.290
Now, now, remember, this is sightseeing time.

04:37.290 --> 04:40.000
It's not sightseeing, it's recon!
We're working!

04:44.380 --> 04:46.710
The castle doesn't look all that beat up.

04:46.710 --> 04:49.540
But the main street was a total wreck...

04:49.750 --> 04:50.960
You're here.

04:52.000 --> 04:53.420
Number 559...

04:54.630 --> 04:56.580
You know the mission parameters?

04:56.580 --> 04:58.790
Only in regards to Fort First.

05:00.960 --> 05:02.170
Follow me.

05:03.210 --> 05:06.540
The stronghold fell to the Perv faction two days ago.

05:06.540 --> 05:09.830
It's just a small castle town that
should be of little importance.

05:10.330 --> 05:13.920
However, the Cult secretly deployed
their most elite force,

05:13.920 --> 05:16.170
the Children of Diablos, to take it.

05:17.040 --> 05:18.460
There is something here.

05:18.460 --> 05:21.420
Our mission is to find out what the Cult is after.

05:24.290 --> 05:25.500
Number 666!

05:27.210 --> 05:30.080
Do you know why you were chosen for this mission?

05:30.080 --> 05:32.750
Because I am familiar with Fort First.

05:33.040 --> 05:36.080
The royal family uses this stronghold
as a summer resort.

05:36.080 --> 05:37.330
Isn't that right?

05:37.330 --> 05:38.330
Yes.

05:38.330 --> 05:40.130
But that is not the only reason.

05:40.830 --> 05:44.330
I requested you personally, Rose Oriana.

05:45.710 --> 05:49.040
You received your powers directly
from Lord Shadow himself.

05:49.040 --> 05:50.040
Really?

05:50.040 --> 05:51.540
What an honor!

05:52.210 --> 05:53.670
I did...

05:53.670 --> 05:55.540
Is that not true for the two of you?

05:55.790 --> 05:59.130
No, we came here under the guidance
of the Seven Shadows.

05:59.130 --> 06:00.920
Not just us.

06:00.920 --> 06:02.880
I think pretty much everyone.

06:02.880 --> 06:05.380
The only ones in the whole organization
who got power straight from Lord Shadow

06:05.380 --> 06:07.250
are the Seven Shadows.

06:07.250 --> 06:08.460
And me.

06:09.080 --> 06:12.500
I, too, was granted power by Lord Shadow.

06:12.880 --> 06:14.080
You?

06:14.080 --> 06:17.830
Aside from the Seven Shadows,
you and I are the only exceptions.

06:18.290 --> 06:19.290
But...

06:19.290 --> 06:20.500
You are weak.

06:21.290 --> 06:24.000
I am Lord Shadow's loyal servant.

06:24.250 --> 06:27.080
I will eliminate any who are not
worthy of his greatness.

06:30.880 --> 06:32.080
They're on the move.

06:32.380 --> 06:34.250
It looks like there's an awful lot of them.

06:34.540 --> 06:36.460
What lies down that path?

06:36.460 --> 06:38.170
It leads to some ruins.

06:38.170 --> 06:41.460
They say it was a memorial to the warriors
who fought against the Demon Diablos.

06:42.330 --> 06:45.290
But now it's used as an outdoor music hall.

06:45.920 --> 06:47.130
Ruins, eh?

06:53.540 --> 06:55.210
Kouadoi the Gale...

06:55.210 --> 06:56.670
He's one of the Cult's leaders.

06:57.000 --> 06:59.420
And his entire entourage are First Children.

07:00.250 --> 07:01.460
Preparations are complete.

07:01.460 --> 07:02.830
Ah, finally.

07:12.040 --> 07:13.460
That card... It can't be!

07:27.080 --> 07:28.290
It is.

07:28.290 --> 07:29.920
It's just like at the Sanctuary.

07:29.920 --> 07:31.670
Come along, Your Royal Majesty.

07:35.960 --> 07:37.630
Mother?

07:38.670 --> 07:40.790
No... Why?

07:40.790 --> 07:43.210
She's your mother?
That means...

07:43.210 --> 07:46.080
She's the queen of Oriana.
The one who sle-

07:46.580 --> 07:48.790
Now, place your hand on the glyph.

07:57.580 --> 08:00.130
We were right.
Royal blood is the key.

08:01.290 --> 08:04.460
This is the ring of legend,
protected by the Hero Freya!

08:05.170 --> 08:06.460
Prepare for combat.

08:08.290 --> 08:10.330
But I thought this was a reconnaissance mission.

08:10.330 --> 08:12.000
That ring is the key.

08:12.000 --> 08:13.880
We will eradicate them and retrieve it.

08:13.880 --> 08:15.420
Key? What do you mean?

08:15.420 --> 08:16.880
You don't need to know that.

08:16.880 --> 08:19.540
What you do need to know
is that it is crucial that we retrieve it.

08:19.540 --> 08:22.040
Wait, please!
My mother is down there!

08:22.040 --> 08:23.460
Why does that matter?

08:29.540 --> 08:30.750
Who are you?!

08:30.920 --> 08:32.580
Time for the execution.

08:37.580 --> 08:38.580
Why?

08:39.330 --> 08:41.080
Why my mother?

08:41.750 --> 08:43.540
Oh, she's done it now!

08:43.540 --> 08:45.130
We better get down there, too!

08:45.290 --> 08:46.290
Rose?

08:46.710 --> 08:47.920
Rose, is that you?

08:48.960 --> 08:51.080
Why would you attack my mother?

08:51.080 --> 08:52.710
You don't need to know.

08:53.500 --> 08:55.630
You people are from Shadow Garden, aren't you?

08:56.210 --> 08:59.040
I'm impressed that you spied out our location,

08:59.040 --> 09:01.710
but you start your attack
with a falling out among friends?

09:01.710 --> 09:05.580
And as an added bonus,
you even brought us the missing Princess Rose!

09:06.580 --> 09:07.790
Oh, Rose!

09:07.790 --> 09:09.630
I'm so scared!
I'm terrified!

09:09.630 --> 09:11.000
Oh, Rose!

09:11.000 --> 09:13.580
Help me!
You have to save me, Rose!

09:18.670 --> 09:20.210
Number 666!

09:20.460 --> 09:23.540
Howard the Cyclone!
Alphard the Headwind!

09:24.750 --> 09:26.210
I knew you weren't worthy to serve our lord and master.

09:26.210 --> 09:28.750
I knew you weren't worthy to serve our lord and master.
Help me, Rose! You have to protect me!<b></b>

09:28.750 --> 09:29.790
Then you will both, die at my hand!

09:29.790 --> 09:31.540
Then you will both, die at my hand!
Please! I beg of you!<b></b>

09:36.330 --> 09:40.670
The team we sent to investigate Fort First
has engaged in battle.

09:41.670 --> 09:42.670
I see.

09:43.080 --> 09:46.420
Number 559 does occasionally have
trouble restraining herself.

09:47.500 --> 09:51.210
Yes, and Number 666, Princess Rose,

09:51.210 --> 09:53.790
unfortunately saw her mother with the Cult.

09:54.420 --> 09:56.040
And Perv Asshat?

09:56.040 --> 09:57.290
He was absent.

09:57.290 --> 09:58.290
Naturally.

09:58.290 --> 09:59.830
As was the Knight Beyond Men, I assume?

09:59.830 --> 10:00.830
Yes.

10:01.330 --> 10:03.170
Was it all a trap, I wonder?

10:03.170 --> 10:08.040
Ruins, the Heroes' Blood,
and a heavy deployment of First Children...

10:08.420 --> 10:10.080
It was far from subtle.

10:10.750 --> 10:14.960
We've been constantly interfering with
their ruin robberies for a long time now,

10:14.960 --> 10:16.710
but he still hasn't shown himself.

10:17.380 --> 10:19.920
He must be a very patient man,

10:19.920 --> 10:23.920
this Knight Beyond Men,
this Mordred, the Ninth Seat of Rounds.

10:24.210 --> 10:28.380
That he's been able to control the Oriana Kingdom
from the shadows for so long

10:28.380 --> 10:29.750
comes as no surprise, I suppose.

10:29.790 --> 10:42.670
<b>Princess Rose Returns, Citizens Revolt</b>

10:29.960 --> 10:31.960
But that patience of his

10:31.960 --> 10:34.580
doesn't appear to have extended to his pawns.

10:34.580 --> 10:37.580
Perv Asshat does seem to be growing quite restless.

10:37.580 --> 10:39.330
He has expended a large number of pawns

10:39.330 --> 10:41.040
in his attempts to investigate the ruins

10:41.040 --> 10:42.670
and to keep us in check.

10:43.040 --> 10:45.960
Now that he is being required to deal with civil unrest,

10:43.040 --> 10:49.000
<b>Ruling Forced Through, Conservative Revolt Inevitable?</b>

10:45.960 --> 10:47.540
security around the Oriana capital

10:47.540 --> 10:49.000
has lightened considerably.

10:49.670 --> 10:52.210
This will be a good time to send in a
large number of reinforcements.

10:52.210 --> 10:54.420
Have Lambda speed up the organization of troops.

10:54.420 --> 10:55.420
Right away.

10:55.420 --> 10:57.500
As for Princess Rose, we'll let the Cult have her.

10:57.500 --> 10:58.500
Very well.

10:58.500 --> 11:00.790
But this will increase the likelihood that Perv Asshat

11:00.790 --> 11:04.130
and his puppetmaster Mordred will make their move.

11:04.130 --> 11:07.580
That would work out very nicely for us, as well.

11:10.040 --> 11:14.000
As soon as Princess Rose stepped onto
the stage with us and the Cult,

11:14.000 --> 11:16.380
that set everything in motion.

11:16.750 --> 11:20.250
And it was the will of our lord to lead
the princess to this point.

11:20.750 --> 11:24.130
You could even say that he is the one
who set up the board.

11:24.960 --> 11:29.920
Which makes me wonder,
how does he envision the end of this game?

11:31.040 --> 11:34.420
<i>Apparently, the Oriana Kingdom has
no one available to inherit the throne,</i>

11:34.420 --> 11:36.540
<i>and there's a conflict between the
newly formed pro-Perv faction</i>

11:36.540 --> 11:39.540
<i>and the anti-Perv, Old Regime faction.</i>

11:40.420 --> 11:42.420
<i>Factional disputes, war...
</i>Good morning, Cid.<b></b>

11:42.420 --> 11:43.830
<i>Every man's dream.</i>

11:44.920 --> 11:47.290
<i>Surely there is somewhere in all that</i>

11:47.290 --> 11:49.290
<i>where an Eminence in Shadow
can step in and look really cool.</i>

11:49.290 --> 11:50.710
<i>There has to be.</i>

11:51.130 --> 11:52.330
Here you are.

11:52.330 --> 11:54.210
I'll get your breakfast right away.

11:54.500 --> 11:56.960
<i>So, they haven't crowned a new ruler yet.</i>

11:57.460 --> 11:59.670
Maybe I should help with that.

12:00.750 --> 12:04.920
Thank you for offering,
but I'll be fine without any help.

12:05.290 --> 12:09.080
<i>The Oriana Kingdom is rocked by factional disputes
after the death of its king.</i>

12:09.380 --> 12:13.540
<i>The strife is quelled by a new ruler,
guided to victory by a mysterious personage,</i>

12:14.040 --> 12:17.380
<i>an unidentified eminence who
lurks in the shadows of history.</i>

12:17.880 --> 12:19.880
<i>I like it!
I like it a lot.</i>

12:19.880 --> 12:21.710
<i>That's what we call a "fixer move."</i>

12:22.290 --> 12:26.790
<i>If Oriana needs a new ruler,
then Rose seems like the perfect candidate, but...</i>

12:27.290 --> 12:28.500
<i>Come to think of it,</i>

12:28.500 --> 12:30.790
<i>why did she murder her father, anyway?</i>

12:30.790 --> 12:34.250
<i>Was she that unhappy at the idea of
being betrothed to the pervert?</i>

12:34.920 --> 12:36.290
<i>No, that can't be it.</i>

12:36.290 --> 12:37.790
<i>When she looked at me back then,</i>

12:37.790 --> 12:39.830
<i>those were the eyes of someone
who was prepared to do anything.</i>

12:40.460 --> 12:44.750
Would you keep believing in me, come what may?

12:45.380 --> 12:48.460
<i>The resolve to kill her own father
if that's what it took to be queen...</i>

12:48.830 --> 12:52.380
<i>The determination to walk the path of carnage,
to become a supreme tyrant...</i>

12:52.750 --> 12:54.920
<i>Who am I to not believe in that?</i>

12:55.580 --> 12:58.500
<i>As a background character,
and as the Eminence in Shadow,</i>

12:58.500 --> 13:01.130
<i>I will help Rose become the next monarch.</i>

13:01.460 --> 13:03.380
<i>And after she's become the mighty tyrant,</i>

13:03.380 --> 13:06.040
<i>Rose will eventually stand before the heroes,
blocking their way.</i>

13:06.420 --> 13:09.130
<i>But someone will step between them:</i>

13:09.130 --> 13:12.130
<i>the tyrant's former benefactor,
the Eminence in Shadow.</i>

13:12.130 --> 13:13.750
<i>And what's more,
they had once been bosom buddies,</i>

13:13.750 --> 13:15.830
<i>who used to talk of their dreams together.</i>

13:16.380 --> 13:18.380
Yes, it's delectable.

13:18.380 --> 13:21.330
Okay, I get it.
I'll get you another one.

13:21.580 --> 13:23.630
<i>Now that that's worked out, I'd better get ready to-</i>

13:24.670 --> 13:27.040
Collection time!

13:27.630 --> 13:32.330
We humbly offer the good citizens of this town
the right to support their government's army.

13:32.710 --> 13:34.460
So lady, where's your safe?

13:34.460 --> 13:35.670
You can't!

13:35.670 --> 13:37.500
You took everything I had just the other day!

13:37.920 --> 13:39.630
Looks like there's still plenty left.

13:39.630 --> 13:41.670
I need that to cover expenses!

13:41.670 --> 13:43.420
Oh, hey, you can donate this keg!

13:43.420 --> 13:44.040
This is a time to go back to my roots.
Oh, hey, you can donate this keg!<b></b>

13:44.040 --> 13:46.750
This is a time to go back to my roots.
Stop! That's all the spirits I have left!<b></b>

13:46.750 --> 13:48.040
Shut up, lady!

13:48.040 --> 13:51.080
You know, I wouldn't mind if you wanted
to pay with your body.

13:51.830 --> 13:53.960
Oh, make sure to leave some for me.

13:53.960 --> 13:56.000
St-st-stop!

13:56.380 --> 14:03.210
Y-you leave Miss M-M-Mary alone!

14:06.250 --> 14:08.000
Man, that was hilarious!

14:08.000 --> 14:09.880
Ah, the foibles of youth...

14:09.880 --> 14:12.040
Let's take this money and grab a pint!

14:12.210 --> 14:13.420
Cid!

14:13.420 --> 14:15.000
You shouldn't be so reckless!

14:15.000 --> 14:17.460
I'm sorry.

14:18.540 --> 14:21.960
They got away with all your money.

14:23.330 --> 14:24.880
I'll be all right.

14:25.250 --> 14:27.750
Believe it or not, I used to be
a prostitute in Lawless City.

14:28.330 --> 14:31.630
I had to deal with violent customers on a daily basis.

14:32.040 --> 14:36.250
I came so close to giving up so many times,
but I could never bring myself to do it.

14:36.920 --> 14:39.250
I'm sure that's why I got help...

14:39.540 --> 14:40.750
from him.

14:41.710 --> 14:43.630
And now you rescued me, too.

14:46.920 --> 14:48.960
Well, I'll be leaving now.

14:48.960 --> 14:52.000
Are you sure you want to go?
Maybe you should wait until you've healed.

14:52.000 --> 14:54.040
There's something I need to do.

14:54.040 --> 14:55.630
But never mind that, let me pay-

14:55.630 --> 14:58.580
That's all right.
I owe you for saving me.

14:58.960 --> 15:00.210
Are you sure?

15:00.210 --> 15:01.750
Well, goodbye, then.

15:01.750 --> 15:03.880
Yes, I hope to see you again.

15:07.290 --> 15:11.670
<i>They make a dashing entrance,
show off their power, and make a dashing exit.</i>

15:12.000 --> 15:15.290
<i>I don't know who that was, but some people get it.</i>

15:16.580 --> 15:18.630
<i>I can't let them outdo me.</i>

15:24.000 --> 15:26.540
<i>Why do I feel like I'm getting nowhere?</i>

15:26.880 --> 15:28.080
<i>Over the last few days,</i>

15:28.080 --> 15:32.790
<i>I've tried so many things to get a foothold towards
making the Birth of Tyrant Rose a thing, but...</i>

15:34.130 --> 15:36.040
<i>I started by sneaking into a correctional facility.</i>

15:36.040 --> 15:39.790
<i>And while savoring the life of a prisoner,
something I'd always wanted to try,</i>

15:39.790 --> 15:41.880
<i>I observed the intrigue swirling around
the detention center,</i>

15:41.880 --> 15:43.830
<i>with all its thrills and suspense!</i>

15:44.130 --> 15:46.630
<i>Then we made a spectacular jail break!</i>

15:46.960 --> 15:49.880
<i>Then I went straight into joining the volunteer army.</i>

15:49.880 --> 15:53.250
<i>They said we couldn't possibly lose,
but we barely got out with our lives.</i>

15:53.250 --> 15:56.630
<i>It was a good opportunity to recreate one of
the legends told through Oriana's history,</i>

15:56.630 --> 15:58.380
<i>so I helped out from the shadows.</i>

15:59.710 --> 16:01.710
<i>But I guess I went a little overboard.</i>

16:01.710 --> 16:05.580
<i>Because in the end, a bunch of old dudes
I'd never met ended up with all the glory.</i>

16:06.420 --> 16:08.000
This isn't how it's supposed to go.

16:08.000 --> 16:13.210
A fixer is supposed to, like, stand out by
not standing out when standing out, you know?

16:14.710 --> 16:17.290
I knew we were right to pick this side.

16:17.290 --> 16:19.830
I heard they're losing ground on the western front.

16:19.830 --> 16:22.210
And some garbage about
the legend coming back to life?

16:22.630 --> 16:23.880
Speaking of the legend,

16:23.880 --> 16:26.830
I heard something like that
happened around these parts, too.

16:26.830 --> 16:31.000
Yeah, apparently they found an enormous treasure
in the ruins on the other side of the mountains.

16:31.000 --> 16:32.000
<i>Treasure?</i>

16:32.000 --> 16:34.710
Don't even think about it.
Ignorance is bliss.

16:35.040 --> 16:38.630
The higher ups have been acting
really weird these last few days.

16:38.630 --> 16:42.250
If we wanna get out of this alive,
it's about time we get while the getting's good.

16:42.710 --> 16:44.040
Oh, that reminds me.

16:44.040 --> 16:47.290
While we're on our way out, what do you say
we pick up a few women as souvenirs?

16:47.290 --> 16:49.290
How about that girl at the inn...

16:53.210 --> 16:54.580
Who the hell are you?

16:54.580 --> 16:57.330
When you want something, you take it,
even if you have to kill for it.

16:57.920 --> 17:00.040
Don't you just love the rules of Lawless City?

17:00.710 --> 17:01.960
I know I do.

17:02.380 --> 17:05.040
Basically, it means the strongest guy is always right.

17:07.380 --> 17:09.130
And that makes me right.

17:21.290 --> 17:22.500
It's hopeless.

17:22.880 --> 17:26.250
Forget about this month's rent.
I can't even stock up for tomorrow.

17:27.380 --> 17:28.580
Oh, Cid...

17:29.420 --> 17:32.540
I wish I had swallowed my pride
and asked him to pay up.

17:34.040 --> 17:35.290
After all that...

17:35.880 --> 17:37.960
I'm going to have to sell this again.

17:55.630 --> 17:58.750
It's money...

18:14.210 --> 18:16.330
You've been watching over me...

18:17.630 --> 18:18.830
Shadow.

18:23.960 --> 18:26.170
First you defeat Heat Blast and Windstorm,

18:26.170 --> 18:28.130
now Dry Wind and Cool Breeze...

18:28.460 --> 18:29.880
You monster!

18:29.880 --> 18:32.710
Every one of my reinforcements was a First Child!

18:32.710 --> 18:36.670
And you fought continuously against them
for three days and three nights!

18:40.710 --> 18:44.170
But I see even your magic power can't last forever.

18:44.540 --> 18:46.290
You had to make this so difficult.

18:49.960 --> 18:52.880
Cheer up, I won't merely kill you.

18:53.130 --> 18:55.960
I will torture you to death,
along with every member of your team.

18:56.330 --> 18:58.830
I'll start with an arm or a leg...

18:58.830 --> 19:00.710
Despite it all, I am grateful.

19:01.040 --> 19:05.210
After all, now I've obtained the key and Rose Oriana.

19:05.580 --> 19:08.500
If I play these cards right,
I can climb above Perv Asshat,

19:08.500 --> 19:10.170
and I will be the next Knight of Rounds.

19:13.380 --> 19:15.080
It's you...

19:16.130 --> 19:18.710
You've come to save me again!

19:20.580 --> 19:21.790
What?!

19:29.920 --> 19:31.790
Impossible, her arm healed-

19:31.790 --> 19:33.630
No, she grew another one!

19:34.500 --> 19:36.790
It's all thanks to him.

19:36.790 --> 19:38.250
It's his power!

19:42.920 --> 19:44.460
Lord Shadow...

19:44.460 --> 19:47.880
You are the ray of moonlight
that pierces the darkness!

19:48.460 --> 19:50.630
I wish you would take me and...

19:56.790 --> 19:58.330
I'm healed...

19:58.330 --> 19:59.880
It's a miracle.

20:00.420 --> 20:03.750
But what is our lord doing here?

20:06.880 --> 20:09.000
Lord Shadow, it's good to see you again!

20:09.000 --> 20:10.210
The treas-

20:10.210 --> 20:11.670
The ruins, are they through here?

20:12.250 --> 20:14.170
I'm afraid I must report.

20:14.540 --> 20:17.170
It's about the traitor, Number 666.

20:17.460 --> 20:18.880
Number 666?

20:19.130 --> 20:22.000
That woman has betrayed Shadow Garden.

20:22.210 --> 20:24.210
Is that an employee ID number?

20:24.420 --> 20:26.380
She is not worthy of you, Lord Shadow.

20:26.380 --> 20:28.330
Please, give me the order to eliminate-

20:28.330 --> 20:30.040
No, wait!
Please, hold on!<b></b>

20:30.420 --> 20:32.250
She was trying to save her mother!

20:32.250 --> 20:34.380
And as a result, the key was stolen.

20:35.420 --> 20:36.250
She has committed a serious crime.

20:36.250 --> 20:37.420
Did someone steal some Mitsugoshi
She has committed a serious crime.<b></b>

20:37.420 --> 20:39.330
company secrets or something?
She must atone with her death.<b></b>

20:39.710 --> 20:40.750
Death?

20:40.750 --> 20:42.250
What is your problem?

20:42.250 --> 20:43.710
You keep going off about this key!

20:43.710 --> 20:46.750
Do we need it so badly that we have to
stomp all over our friend's feeling?

20:46.750 --> 20:48.630
You do not need to know.

20:49.080 --> 20:53.080
I've had my fill of corporations and betrayal for a while.
And she is not our friend; she is a filthy traitor.<b></b>

20:53.080 --> 20:55.500
Filthy? What is wrong with you?

20:55.500 --> 20:57.210
You've been trying to pick a fight this whole mission!

20:57.210 --> 21:00.040
<b>Princess Rose Announces Marriage to Chancellor Asshat</b>

20:57.750 --> 21:00.040
I don't remember giving you grunts permission to whine.

21:00.830 --> 21:02.330
I've had enough of your-

21:02.330 --> 21:03.540
Marriage?

21:03.750 --> 21:04.750
Lord Shadow?

21:04.750 --> 21:07.420
Rose is getting married?

21:07.880 --> 21:09.080
That's absurd!

21:09.080 --> 21:10.460
Then why...

21:10.460 --> 21:11.920
Why did she...

21:11.920 --> 21:13.540
What was it for?!

21:14.000 --> 21:15.210
I won't allow it.

21:15.210 --> 21:19.500
Rose Oriana, your betrayal will be punished.

21:20.330 --> 21:22.540
You will pay!

21:24.170 --> 21:25.170
Huh? Why?

21:25.170 --> 21:26.880
I knew I could count on you, Lord Shadow!

21:26.880 --> 21:28.080
Wait a minute-

21:30.830 --> 21:33.500
May it all be according to your will.

21:34.500 --> 21:35.710
No...

21:35.710 --> 21:37.750
Number 666...

21:39.580 --> 21:40.920
<i>Rose...</i>

21:40.920 --> 21:43.580
<i>What did you kill your father for?</i>

21:43.920 --> 21:46.040
<i>Was it not so you could be the supreme tyrant?</i>

21:46.710 --> 21:49.710
<i>You're giving up now?
And getting married?</i>

21:51.040 --> 21:54.630
<i>It is the existence of light that makes
shadow shine so brightly.</i>

21:55.960 --> 21:59.460
<i>If my Eminence in Shadow shtick
is ever going to get anywhere,</i>

21:59.460 --> 22:03.000
<i>I need her to be the next ruler!</i>

22:03.290 --> 22:06.420
I'm coming for you, Rose Oriana!

22:24.420 --> 22:28.290
An endlessly deep dark night
Doko made mo fukai yamiyo to<b></b>

22:28.290 --> 22:31.130
I thought, as I closed my eyes
Omotte me o tsubutteta<b></b>

22:31.130 --> 22:36.330
Still unaware of the voice of the star calling out to me
Yobikakeru hoshi no koe ni kizukenai mama<b></b>

22:36.710 --> 22:40.670
A faint light, not too bright
Mabushiku wa nai awai hi<b></b>

22:40.670 --> 22:43.420
But comforting, that's how you were
Kokochi ii sonna anata o<b></b>

22:43.420 --> 22:47.290
Before I knew it, I was following you with my eyes
Shiranu uchi ni me de oikaketa<b></b>

22:47.290 --> 22:49.880
Even if I run out of breath
Iki o kirashite<b></b>

22:50.290 --> 22:53.330
And start to stumble
Motsuresou ni natte mo<b></b>

22:53.330 --> 22:55.580
I've never felt this before
Kono kimochi wa hajimete<b></b>

22:55.580 --> 22:59.500
I can't stop the feeling
Mita koto no nai jibun ni aeru<b></b>

22:59.880 --> 23:03.330
That I can meet a me I've never seen before
Yokan ga tomaranai<b></b>

23:03.830 --> 23:06.750
I run down the path in front of me
Me no mae no michi o hashiru<b></b>

23:06.750 --> 23:09.830
I run far, even when I'm lost
Tooku, mayotte mo<b></b>

23:09.830 --> 23:13.670
If I look up, you won't have changed
Miagereba anata wa kawaranaide<b></b>

23:13.670 --> 23:16.040
You'll be there
Soko ni iru koto o<b></b>

23:16.040 --> 23:19.000
It may be strange, but I can believe it
Fushigi demo shinjirareru<b></b>

23:19.000 --> 23:22.040
Kaze ga tsuyoi hi mo
Even on windy days<b></b>

23:22.040 --> 23:26.540
I don't have to try to reach over you
Over you todokeyou to shinakutatte ii<b></b>

23:26.540 --> 23:28.880
Hey (Did you know?)
Nee (Shitteru?)<b></b>

23:28.880 --> 23:31.920
As all the stars revolve
Subete no hoshi ga mawarinagara<b></b>

23:31.920 --> 23:35.170
I keep my sights on you
Anata o mezashiteru<b></b>

23:35.170 --> 23:38.130
Polaris in the Night
